<title>UK: LIFFE coffee down $320 after NY fall, cocoa lower.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee down $320 after NY fall, cocoa lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - July opens $270 down after sharp spec sell-off in NY on Friday, then weakens further. Down $320 at $2,150 at 1003 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Opens lower but above expectations, all positions slightly weaker in thin trade. July off six at 1,032 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Slow start. August unchanged at $324.10.</p>
</text>
